    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58736" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυμβ-άω</span></b>  (
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυμβ-φάω</span></b>  acc. to <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			526.2
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dive, plunge
			headlong</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸν Τάρταρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					108.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰ φρέατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					350a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>La.</u>
				193c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.44
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς κολυμβήθραν μύρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					300
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>swim</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς δυναμένους κολυμβᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					27.43
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				26
			</span></i>.</div>
